    "Check in on recovery quality, especially sleep and nutrition around leg training days, as last period's note flagged recovery as something to watch and the leg dip may be an early signal.",
    "Keep back, biceps, and triceps volume consistent — these groups are stable and simply need to be maintained while you drive progress on legs and continue building chest and shoulder strength."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "Chest and shoulders progressed this period; legs had a minor strength index dip (108 to 107) that needs to be reversed next period, while back, biceps, and triceps remained stable."
}
